# Templates this repository carries in place of the installed ntc-templates ones.
# cli_parse reads this index first and falls back to the ntc-templates index for
# every command not listed here. Same format as the ntc-templates index. A row
# here is matched ahead of every ntc-templates row, so its pattern matches no
# command another ntc-templates row serves: the route rows end in `$` and name
# the one command the collector sends, where the ntc-templates rows for the
# same templates match a prefix that `show ip route summary` also begins with.
#
Template, Hostname, Platform, Command

cisco_ios_show_ip_access-lists.textfsm, .*, cisco_ios, sh[[ow]] ip acce[[ss-lists]]
cisco_ios_show_ip_route.textfsm, .*, cisco_ios, sh[[ow]] ip ro[[ute]] vrf \*$
cisco_xr_show_ip_route.textfsm, .*, cisco_xr, sh[[ow]] ro[[ute]] vrf all ipv4$
